WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Brought to you by Bayi Subs

00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:41.740
Original Work: VIVIAN

00:00:44.060 --> 00:00:47.020
Producer: Zhou Zhengzi

00:00:50.020 --> 00:00:52.440
Chief Supervisor: Li Xiaoting

00:00:56.980 --> 00:00:59.900
Assistant Supervisors: Liu Xing, Zhu Ke

00:01:00.740 --> 00:01:02.740
Chief of Post-production: Liu Xing

00:01:03.420 --> 00:01:06.080
Post-production: Zhu Ke

00:01:06.640 --> 00:01:09.480
Art Supervisor: Shen Ling

00:01:10.120 --> 00:01:12.380
Performances: Ma Cheng Di

00:01:13.480 --> 00:01:15.720
Manga Editor: Hao Yue

00:01:40.420 --> 00:01:46.240
Director: Xiong Ke

00:02:10.940 --> 00:02:12.600
Can't you please give us a little more leeway?

00:02:12.600 --> 00:02:14.600
Have a little more compassion?

00:02:14.600 --> 00:02:17.060
Hey man, we've already pushed three other groups ahead of you.

00:02:17.260 --> 00:02:18.660
If we keep pushing you back...

00:02:18.660 --> 00:02:20.020
You'll be automatically disqualified from the competition.

00:02:20.020 --> 00:02:21.480
If you're having difficulties, take care of them now.

00:02:21.480 --> 00:02:23.480
You guys are next!

00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:37.160
Super cute! Xiao Xuan Xuan!

00:02:38.020 --> 00:02:40.640
Xiao Xuan Xuan! Xiao Xuan Xuan!

00:02:41.400 --> 00:02:44.540
Super cute! Xiao Xuan Xuan!

00:02:50.560 --> 00:02:52.560
Yo, are you guys competing or not?

00:02:52.560 --> 00:02:53.580
Why are you just standing there?

00:02:54.660 --> 00:02:55.720
Please be quiet, everyone!

00:03:01.520 --> 00:03:04.500
Toss, oh toss, the handkerchief!

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:08.839
Gently place it behind our little friend!

00:03:09.360 --> 00:03:11.920
No one tell them that it's there!

00:03:12.320 --> 00:03:14.459
Gahhh! He's sooo freaking cute!

00:03:14.460 --> 00:03:16.200
What the hell is this?

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:18.500
We want Xuan Xuan!

00:03:20.300 --> 00:03:22.300
Quickly, quickly...

00:03:22.820 --> 00:03:24.820
We want Xuan Xuan!

00:03:24.820 --> 00:03:26.820
Hurry up!

00:03:26.820 --> 00:03:28.820
Let Xuan Xuan come on stage!

00:03:29.880 --> 00:03:31.880
Heh, I bet they're fresh out of tricks now!

00:03:32.280 --> 00:03:34.280
Time for the clown to withdraw.

00:03:35.240 --> 00:03:37.240
We want Xuan Xuan!

00:03:37.240 --> 00:03:39.240
Xuan Xuan!

00:03:39.580 --> 00:03:41.580
Come out!

00:03:42.220 --> 00:03:44.000
Everyone, please quiet down for a moment.

00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:46.000
Please listen to me!

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:47.380
In actuality...

00:03:47.380 --> 00:03:49.380
I came today with a friend.

00:03:49.380 --> 00:03:50.920
I think right now...

00:03:50.920 --> 00:03:52.780
The person suffering the most is her.

00:03:52.780 --> 00:03:54.340
In the interest of not hurting others,

00:03:54.340 --> 00:03:56.340
She's always worked hard to disguise her true self.

00:03:57.140 --> 00:03:58.839
No one knew...

00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:01.280
How much it's pained her to hide what she loves.

00:04:02.160 --> 00:04:03.540
In truth,

00:04:03.540 --> 00:04:04.780
Even I only found out today

00:04:04.780 --> 00:04:06.260
That she enjoys Cosplay.

00:04:06.260 --> 00:04:07.679
Even though in the beginning,

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:09.200
I was taken aback...

00:04:09.200 --> 00:04:11.200
I now want to tell her...

00:04:11.200 --> 00:04:12.700
That when you Cosplay,

00:04:12.700 --> 00:04:14.440
You are...

00:04:14.440 --> 00:04:15.600
The most confident,

00:04:15.600 --> 00:04:16.719
The most natural,

00:04:16.720 --> 00:04:18.720
The most REAL you I have ever seen.

00:04:19.360 --> 00:04:20.320
Tang Xuan!

00:04:20.320 --> 00:04:21.599
Where are you?

00:04:21.600 --> 00:04:23.380
Are you listening?

00:04:23.380 --> 00:04:24.659
Tang Xuan!

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:26.660
Come out! Please!

00:04:27.360 --> 00:04:28.800
Haoyi...

00:04:32.840 --> 00:04:33.520
Oh my God!

00:04:33.520 --> 00:04:35.520
Someone's falling!

00:04:38.060 --> 00:04:38.860
Tang Xuan!

00:04:47.020 --> 00:04:48.159
What's going on!?

00:04:48.260 --> 00:04:49.380
What the-

00:05:19.880 --> 00:05:21.880
Holy crap, that was AMAZING!

00:05:21.880 --> 00:05:23.520
Their producers are way too generous!

00:05:23.520 --> 00:05:25.120
They must've burned all their cash away for this!

00:05:27.640 --> 00:05:29.000
Tang Xuan.

00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:30.540
Are you alright?

00:05:36.740 --> 00:05:39.140
Woah, from the sound of the crowd,

00:05:39.140 --> 00:05:41.500
It's pretty obvious that we've already got our winners!

00:05:41.880 --> 00:05:43.120
And they are...

00:05:43.120 --> 00:05:46.260
Xiao Yi Yi and Xuan Xuan!

00:05:51.700 --> 00:05:52.840
Xiao Xuan Xuan!

00:05:52.840 --> 00:05:54.840
Haoyi's sooo cool...

00:05:55.280 --> 00:05:57.280
A shame it isn't me up there...

00:05:58.780 --> 00:06:00.780
Heh, I had no idea you guys could do magic!

00:06:01.920 --> 00:06:03.920
Hey! Don't think I don't know!

00:06:03.920 --> 00:06:05.560
This isn't some magic or whatever!

00:06:05.560 --> 00:06:06.440
Tell me!

00:06:06.440 --> 00:06:08.000
What actually happened?

00:06:15.620 --> 00:06:17.620
Thank goodness I got here in time.

00:06:19.220 --> 00:06:20.040
Jiang Haoyi!

00:06:20.040 --> 00:06:21.000
Tell me, tell me!

00:06:21.640 --> 00:06:23.219
Hey, don't talk so loud.

00:06:23.220 --> 00:06:24.520
Are you that moved?

00:06:25.800 --> 00:06:28.960
She dares to go after MY Haoyi SO BOLDLY?

00:06:29.560 --> 00:06:30.860
She dares...

00:06:30.860 --> 00:06:32.180
Unforgivable...

00:06:32.560 --> 00:06:34.180
I'm going to cleave you in half!

00:06:34.800 --> 00:06:38.140
Wow, we destroyed Xuan Xuan's costume and she still got first place?

00:06:38.140 --> 00:06:39.340
What has this world come to?

00:06:39.880 --> 00:06:41.360
Well, I've got to admit.

00:06:41.360 --> 00:06:42.880
That trap up there is pretty damn cute.

00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:45.080
Let's get him to join our group next time, mm?

00:06:45.080 --> 00:06:45.940
Hey, yeah!

00:06:45.940 --> 00:06:46.600
Let's have him join us!

00:06:46.600 --> 00:06:47.140
Yeah!

00:06:47.140 --> 00:06:48.020
He's pretty cute!

00:06:48.140 --> 00:06:50.539
Even you all want to steal my man, huh?

00:06:57.500 --> 00:06:58.920
Unforgivable...

00:06:58.920 --> 00:07:00.920
The day of your deaths is here!

00:07:03.120 --> 00:07:04.180
So tired...

00:07:04.180 --> 00:07:05.100
You're okay, right?

00:07:05.100 --> 00:07:06.380
We won, after all.

00:07:06.380 --> 00:07:08.040
Hey! This is the girls' dressing room.

00:07:08.040 --> 00:07:09.080
You can't come in here!

00:07:09.080 --> 00:07:10.539
Hey, sister.

00:07:10.540 --> 00:07:11.760
My clothes are still in here.

00:07:11.760 --> 00:07:12.620
Fine then.

00:07:13.040 --> 00:07:14.000
But I'm changing first.

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:14.740
You go wait outside.

00:07:14.940 --> 00:07:15.680
Wait.

00:07:16.380 --> 00:07:17.460
I change pretty fast, ok?

00:07:17.460 --> 00:07:18.180
Let me go first.

00:07:19.560 --> 00:07:20.180
No way!

00:07:20.280 --> 00:07:21.700
My underwear is still in there!

00:07:21.700 --> 00:07:22.520
I'm going first!

00:07:22.520 --> 00:07:23.960
Are you even a man, huh?

00:07:23.960 --> 00:07:25.200
Ladies first! Don't you understand?

00:07:25.200 --> 00:07:26.240
You didn't get my permission

00:07:26.240 --> 00:07:27.420
when you guys stripped me!

00:07:27.420 --> 00:07:28.480
No means no!

00:07:28.480 --> 00:07:29.560
Get out of my way!

00:07:39.220 --> 00:07:41.540
T-T-T-Tang Xuan...

00:07:41.600 --> 00:07:42.720
You...

00:07:43.720 --> 00:07:45.300
PERVERT!!

00:07:50.920 --> 00:07:52.920
My clothes, MA'AM.

00:07:57.680 --> 00:07:58.260
Oy!

00:08:00.620 --> 00:08:01.860
Asshole! PERVERT!!!

00:08:03.920 --> 00:08:06.420
I'm a victim too, you know...

00:08:10.120 --> 00:08:10.740
Hey, peasant.

00:08:10.740 --> 00:08:11.780
What's wrong with you?

00:08:11.780 --> 00:08:13.280
You have the gall to ask me what's wrong?

00:08:13.280 --> 00:08:14.599
Didn't YOU cause all of this?

00:08:20.200 --> 00:08:21.420
Gahhh PEASANT.

00:08:21.420 --> 00:08:22.980
Hurry up and put your clothes on!

00:08:22.980 --> 00:08:24.980
To disrespect the gods will get you your eyes gouged out!

00:08:26.180 --> 00:08:29.000
Hey it's your fault for not telling me those magic clothes disappear after a while.

00:08:30.780 --> 00:08:32.419
I'm... I'm sorry, okay?

00:08:32.419 --> 00:08:33.419
To be honest,

00:08:33.419 --> 00:08:34.919
I'm not very good at magic.

00:08:34.919 --> 00:08:36.860
I make mistakes when I get nervous.

00:08:37.340 --> 00:08:40.880
I have the worst grades out of all of my friends...

00:08:40.880 --> 00:08:41.640
And...

00:08:41.640 --> 00:08:42.600
Ah, forget it.

00:08:42.840 --> 00:08:44.200
It wasn't your fault to begin with.

00:08:44.380 --> 00:08:46.380
If it weren't for you saving us at just the right time...

00:08:46.380 --> 00:08:48.380
There's no way I could've saved Tang Xuan.

00:08:50.200 --> 00:08:51.900
It's all thanks to you staying by my side.

00:08:51.900 --> 00:08:53.020
So thank you.

00:08:53.680 --> 00:08:56.359
The minds of humans sure are strange.

00:09:04.180 --> 00:09:05.180
Haoyi.

00:09:06.160 --> 00:09:07.579
Can we go home now?

00:09:08.460 --> 00:09:11.820
Ohhh crap, I completely forget about her!

00:09:12.520 --> 00:09:13.400
Tang Xuan,

00:09:13.400 --> 00:09:14.180
I'm going home.

00:09:14.180 --> 00:09:14.979
Wanna come with?

00:09:16.400 --> 00:09:17.439
You can go if you want.

00:09:17.620 --> 00:09:18.660
Why are you asking me to tag along?

00:09:36.760 --> 00:09:38.100
Tang Xuan...

00:09:38.100 --> 00:09:42.260
We'll make sure you pay us back twofold for this!

00:09:53.840 --> 00:09:54.960
I'll only take you this far, then.

00:09:54.960 --> 00:09:56.220
I have some things to take care of.

00:09:57.460 --> 00:09:59.460
Is it something to do with Tang Xuan?

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:02.380
Well, I'll just be going then.

00:10:02.840 --> 00:10:04.620
Today was really fun!

00:10:05.620 --> 00:10:07.040
See you tomorrow, Haoyi.

00:10:09.480 --> 00:10:11.720
She's so considerate.

00:10:15.200 --> 00:10:16.960
I wonder how Tang Xuan...

00:10:25.140 --> 00:10:26.160
Tang Xuan.

00:10:36.760 --> 00:10:38.760
Yo. Where's your Miss Princess?

00:10:39.400 --> 00:10:40.720
I told her to go on without me.

00:10:40.860 --> 00:10:42.860
There're some things I'd like to discuss with you.

00:10:43.380 --> 00:10:44.060
What?

00:10:44.820 --> 00:10:45.760
Are you pitying me?

00:10:46.780 --> 00:10:47.819
Tang Xuan,

00:10:47.820 --> 00:10:48.480
Um.

00:10:48.480 --> 00:10:50.480
You uh, tonight...

00:10:50.600 --> 00:10:52.440
Could you come to my place...

00:10:53.100 --> 00:10:55.100
Could you come sleep at my place?

00:10:58.540 --> 00:11:00.280
FREAK! MONSTER! PERVERT!

00:11:00.280 --> 00:11:01.620
I'm never talking to you again!

00:11:05.120 --> 00:11:06.060
Well...

00:11:06.320 --> 00:11:07.960
It looks like her wish has already come true.

00:11:08.260 --> 00:11:10.260
The magic has been lifted.

00:11:10.600 --> 00:11:11.820
But, Tang Xuan...

00:11:11.820 --> 00:11:14.240
When will you be able to show your true self?

00:11:48.380 --> 00:11:50.260
Who might that be, at this hour?

00:11:55.580 --> 00:11:58.180
Wow, you haven't been here in ages.

00:11:58.180 --> 00:11:59.280
And this late, too.

00:12:00.060 --> 00:12:00.800
Come, come.

00:12:00.800 --> 00:12:02.000
Come on in.

00:12:02.260 --> 00:12:03.840
Jiang Haoyi...
